# Badminton Talent App - Text-Based Prediction

## Overview
This project predicts the recommended sport for users based on **textual input data** (age, height, weight, experience, and interest). 
Currently, the focus is on **Badminton**.

## Data
The CSV file (`data/user_text_data.csv`) contains sample user information:

| name | age | height_cm | weight_kg | experience_years | interest_level |
|------|-----|-----------|-----------|-----------------|----------------|

## How it Works
1. Load user data from CSV
2. Standardize features
3. Train a KNN model
4. Predict the recommended sport for new users

## Run in Google Colab
1. Upload the project folder to Google Drive
2. Open Colab and mount Drive
3. Run `text_model.py` or paste the code into a Colab cell

## Requirements
pandas
scikit-learn
